# The Task 5 e2e mock-API fixtures deliberately reuse filenames excluded
# above (factory.json, setup/) because those are also real field names in
# the live Forge API this UI proxies to; the fixture naming rule requires
# matching them exactly. These are synthetic, checked-in test data (no
# secrets), not the live/private state those rules exist to keep out.
!/ui/tests/e2e/fixtures/**/factory.json
!/ui/tests/e2e/fixtures/setup/
!/ui/tests/e2e/fixtures/setup/**
.superpowers/

